 "status": "Proposal. P1 only if the body map ships tonight (intensity + qualities on tap). Everything else is roadmap.",
 "disclaimer_en": "ORBIT records where pain is, how strong it is and what it feels like. It does not name a cause or diagnose. Patterns are offered to her; nothing is applied without her choice.",
